/E (Linux Project v10 is a comprehensive simulation of a real-world cyber attack and defense lifecycle, executed within a controlled laboratory environment. The project aims to bridge the gap between theoretical security concepts and practical application by establishing a multi-layered infrastructure consisting of a vulnerable web application \(Target\), an offensive workstation \(Attacker\), and a Security Information and Event Management \(SIEM\) solution for monitoring and detection. )
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [5]
>>
