/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 133 0 R
/T ("As part of the foundational infrastructure setup, I deployed and configured the primary virtual machines required for the project. An Ubuntu Linux system was established as the Target Machine, hosting the vulnerable web application to serve as the focal point for the attack simulations. Simultaneously, a Windows-based machine was configured to host the SIEM solution, serving as the central security monitoring hub. This setup ensured the seamless ingestion, correlation, and analysis of logs and security events forwarded from the Ubuntu target, providing full visibility across the environment." )
/E ("As part of the foundational infrastructure setup, I deployed and configured the primary virtual machines required for the project. An Ubuntu Linux system was established as the Target Machine, hosting the vulnerable web application to serve as the focal point for the attack simulations. Simultaneously, a Windows-based machine was configured to host the SIEM solution, serving as the central security monitoring hub. This setup ensured the seamless ingestion, correlation, and analysis of logs and security events forwarded from the Ubuntu target, providing full visibility across the environment." )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
