/T (The Splunk Enterprise platform was utilized as the core SIEM solution on the Windows machine. As shown in the configuration, a UDP data input was established on Port 514 to ingest Syslog data. This configuration enables the centralized collection and indexing of logs from the Ubuntu target, providing the necessary visibility for real-time monitoring and incident investigation." ====================================================================== )
/E (The Splunk Enterprise platform was utilized as the core SIEM solution on the Windows machine. As shown in the configuration, a UDP data input was established on Port 514 to ingest Syslog data. This configuration enables the centralized collection and indexing of logs from the Ubuntu target, providing the necessary visibility for real-time monitoring and incident investigation." ====================================================================== )
