/P 160 0 R
/E (V10 project successfully demonstrated the critical importance of a multi-layered defense strategy. By bridging the gap between offensive exploitation and SIEM-based detection, this project highlights how visibility and rapid code remediation \(Git\) work together to secure modern infrastructures. All objectives were met, providing a complete proof of concept for a hardened, monitored, and auditable environment. )
/Pg 38 0 R
/K [1]
>>
